```

**Fix**: Move the shutdown handler after server creation or define it differently:

```javascript
const server = app.listen(3000, () => {
  console.log('Server running on port 3000');

  // Define shutdown handler after server creation
  process.on('SIGTERM', () => {
    console.log('SIGTERM signal received: closing HTTP server');
    server.close(() => {
      console.log('HTTP server closed');
      process.exit(0);
    });
  });
